    {
      "post_id": "553192373728342016",
      "text": "Saying #JeSuisCharlie or \"I stand with Charlie\" isn't an endorsement of their cartoons, IMO. It's defending right to satirise without harm.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:11:54 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553195922872889345",
      "text": "@NicoleFroio I agree, and I think for most people saying \"I stand with Charlie\" is about that",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:26:00 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5319373543849165e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553200303781478400",
      "text": "@CHARL3TTE I'd like people to show me examples when they say Hebdo was generalising about Muslims.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:43:25 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.532000825906381e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553196256018046977",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal I sure hope so. Personally the hashtag makes me uncomfortable but it's just a matter of opinion I think.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:27:19 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5319592287288934e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553193656338092032",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal my point on Huff - we are standing up 4 what makes us human. Expressing ourselves freely http://t.co/0uswweUiKz #JeSuisCharlie",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:17:00 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5319321964396544e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553201046802415617",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal that's nice for you but it's not the point.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:46:22 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.532003037814784e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553193505750003712",
      "text": "@NicoleFroio I am no fan of all their cartoons but I think solidarity important in this case",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:16:24 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5319276276680294e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553202372067864576",
      "text": "@rameez_zafar @sunny_hundal killing is not acceptable, it's a foolish act and makes people lose respect.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:51:38 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53193339667755e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553198999550042112",
      "text": "@NicoleFroio Good to know other people are uncomfortable with this hashtag too!  @sunny_hundal",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:38:14 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53196256018047e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553197250508099584",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal It's a defiant affirmation of freedom of speech, (whether satirical or no)  #JeSuisCharlie http://t.co/mzlYihmq2i",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:31:17 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553198094444404736",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal u can stand up for free speech without aligning urself with a mag that satirized the ppl who get backlash from these attacks",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:34:38 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553193547160354816",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal Right to satirise without harm is endorsement of all satire, since freedom exists without limitation",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:16:34 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553193339667755009",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal can you satirise the emotions of Europeans regarding Holocaust and Hitler in the same way?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:15:44 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553200082590638081",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal I don't have an example but I dont think I need one to say there are better ways we can show support for both speech and Islam",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:42:32 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5319943369825485e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553205684951478272",
      "text": "@abywitter sure. Nobody can justify the killing.  @sunny_hundal",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 15:04:48 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.532023720678646e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553197220405985280",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal I'm NOT Charlie, #JeSuisAhmed the dead cop. Charlie ridiculed my faith and culture and I died defending his right to do so.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:31:09 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553193202489257984",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal @eleanor__p_ it's nice that you think so",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:15:11 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553197450681667584",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal @jonworth any hashtag that's widely used is going to be imperfect and inarticulate. Especially when used for broad solidarity.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:32:04 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553193219643965440",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal indeed - we are saying no one should be killed for satire or cartoons EVER. It's irrelevant what anyone thinks of them.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:15:16 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553199327695626241",
      "text": "@Babytanguera I am very uncomfortable with it, you are not alone.  @sunny_hundal",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:39:32 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531989995500421e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553198836735574016",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal And the cartoons should still be published. There is a difference between 'distaste' and 'I want this banned'.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:37:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553193735438491648",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal I feel that it is fully possible to have solidarity for those killed and not endorse the cartoons.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:17:19 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531935057500037e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553192762766802944",
      "text": "@sunny_hundal you may be right but the hashtag still makes me uncomfortable.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:13:27 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53192373728342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553202050129870848",
      "text": "@tbepublic @sunny_hundal its a contradictory statement.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 14:50:21 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531935471603548e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553194454920986627",
      "text": "@rameez_zafar satirise Hitler all you want. Hebdo did",
